  Q.war_weariness += 5;
  Q.leninist_strength += 5; Q.leftcom_strength -= 5;
  Q.leftcom_dissent += 10; 
!}

After a long debate in the Petrograd Soviet, tentative approval is given for the peace position, weakening the leverage of the <span style="color: var(--leftcom); font-weight: bold;">Leftcoms</span>. 

